{
    "title": "Word Connect: Crossword Puzzle",
    "description": "<b>Fun and relaxing crossword puzzle!</b>\r\n\r\nWord Connect is a fun but challenging word game.\r\nEnjoy modern word game with the combine of word search and crossword! In this fantastic crossword puzzle, you will improve your vocabulary and spelling skills.\r\n\r\n<b>How to play?</b>\r\n- Fill in every block with a word! \r\n- Find and guess the hidden words in a crossword-style grid.\r\n- Find as many words as possible to level up and earn bonus rewards!\r\n\r\n<b>Features:</b>\r\n\u2605 Daily bonus coins for you!\r\n\u2605 Fun and relaxing word search brain game!\r\n\u2605 Get 500 coins at the first word game login.\r\n\u2605 Simple, easy, and addictive crossword puzzle!\r\n\u2605 Play offline in anytime and anywhere and no wifi.\r\n\u2605 Get your word hunt on with 5000+ cross word puzzles!\r\n\u2605 Difficulty increases as the level. Easy to play, but hard to master!\r\n\r\nGet Word Connect for word game fans, word search addicts, and more! Play this crossword puzzle game while inspiring your word level.\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/freepuzzlegames/",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Fun and relaxing crossword puzzle!</b><br><br>Word Connect is a fun but challenging word game.<br>Enjoy modern word game with the combine of word search and crossword! In this fantastic crossword puzzle, you will improve your vocabulary and spelling skills.<br><br><b>How to play?</b><br>- Fill in every block with a word! <br>- Find and guess the hidden words in a crossword-style grid.<br>- Find as many words as possible to level up and earn bonus rewards!<br><br><b>Features:</b><br>\u2605 Daily bonus coins for you!<br>\u2605 Fun and relaxing word search brain game!<br>\u2605 Get 500 coins at the first word game login.<br>\u2605 Simple, easy, and addictive crossword puzzle!<br>\u2605 Play offline in anytime and anywhere and no wifi.<br>\u2605 Get your word hunt on with 5000+ cross word puzzles!<br>\u2605 Difficulty increases as the level. Easy to play, but hard to master!<br><br>Get Word Connect for word game fans, word search addicts, and more! Play this crossword puzzle game while inspiring your word level.<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/freepuzzlegames/",
